# Stop superseded basket work

`Basket redesign.zip` is **superseded**. Stop immediately if that is the task you were given. Do not write files for it.

Canonical order page is **New mods v2** on **`/cart`**. `/pages/checkout` is a redirect to `/cart`. Shopify hosted `/checkout` is payment only.

## Do not touch (except to keep this contract)

- `valtora-theme/sections/main-cart.liquid` — the order surface
- `preview/pages/cart.html` — preview of the same
- Cart/checkout CSS in `preview/base.css` and `valtora-theme/assets/base.css` (`checkout-leadband` / `checkout-layout` / `checkout-bar`)
- Cart helpers in `preview/theme.js` and `valtora-theme/assets/theme.js`: `pieceCountOf`, `checkoutFootprint*`, `initCheckoutPage`, qty/remove, concierge and removal steppers

Do not move the lead-time band. Do not send `/cart` to `/pages/checkout`. Keep `/pages/checkout` as a redirect.

Size-selector redesign from the zip is out of scope until the user asks for it.
